This means that the default type of torsor is a pseudo torsor which is trivial on an fpqc covering. This is the definition in <span class="cite">[<span class="postnote">Exposé IV, 6.5</span>, <a href="/bibliography/SGA3">SGA3</a>]</span>. It is a little bit inconvenient for us as we most often work in the fppf topology.